        {
          "id": "body",
          "type": "text",
          "role": "content",
          "text": "I'm ***Sam Rivera***, and I started Acme to make everyday routines a little lighter.\n\nPeople kept telling me the same thing: it's the small daily jobs that wear you down.\n\nSo we built **Acme**: simple tools, made with care, that each do one job well.\n\nWe also made **Ace**, a friendly guide that turns routines into small wins.\n\nEvery week I'll share practical tips, behind-the-scenes stories and ideas you can try right away.\n\nThanks for joining us. There's plenty more to come.",
          "size": 13.3,
          "lineHeight": 16,
          "color": "text",
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cta",
      "type": "button",
      "role": "content",
      "size": 21.1,
      "color": "primary",
      "width": 316,
